r.\n\nI never took her to the vet for required shots.\n\nWhen she got the shits, I fed her white rice.\n\nShe died in my arms a few years ago.\n\nI miss the small bruises on my wrists from the epic slap-fights.\n\nShe was somewhat of a cunt, but we loved each other.  And the state has no record she even existed.  \n\nWin for her.\n\n", "author": "KuzoKevin", "created": 1785584196035, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Chrisquiet", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "So, I rescued a dog and the state didn't know she existed.", "last_comment_created": 1785587759270, "content": "<p>I had her for about ten years.</p>\n<p>I never registered her and got a license to own her.</p>\n<p>I never took her to the vet for required shots.</p>\n<p>When she got the shits, I fed her white rice.</p>\n<p>She died in my arms a few years ago.</p>\n<p>I miss the small bruises on my wrists from the epic slap-fights.</p>\n<p>She was somewhat of a cunt, but we loved each other.  And the state has no record she even existed.</p>\n<p>Win for her.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 2, "score_up": 22, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2083379768016109615/", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATC4mbaqp", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 22, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8758063, "raw_content": "", "author": "rdvs34283", "created": 1785582273412, "profile_picture": "p9HQtd